{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行大号白字和紫色强调词首先吸引视线，最先注意到“想回去”“舍不得被当作自己人的日子”；随后容易扫到下方大号的“一阵心慌，连往下想都不敢了”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他想回去，却说不清自己究竟是怀念曾经被当作自己人的日子，还是因为害怕孤单而愿意重新忍受那些委屈。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舍不得、怕孤单、矛盾；想到这个问题时心慌、退缩。\",\n  \"missed\": \"中间小字里音乐由沉重转为漂浮的变化，以及重新面对过去的自己、最初的问题仍然没有答案等过程细节。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方主句较长，怀念归属感和害怕孤单是两层不同的动机，需要较快地顺着整句辨认。\",\n    \"中间四行小字连续堆叠，视觉上容易略过，难以快速筛选其中的叙事信息。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3e2cfcf2-5f1d-4642-9ee5-842f7e4dbf0c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T023129927757Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:32:29.047754+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8cd2067d00053ab9b1b54d159b0376fb2fa4b32d5e85b69b52acb30d868c371e", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat